namespace cdm.ingest.fixml.example : <"Placeholder FIXML ingest surface: exists to demonstrate the split pattern on a namespace parallel to cdm.ingest.fpml.*. Contains a single trivial passthrough function so the FIXML profile and sibling module have something to build. Real FIXML mapping work would populate this namespace and file with actual FIXML→CDM mappings, mirroring how ingest-fpml-*.rosetta files are structured.">
version "${project.version}"

func ExampleFixmlPassthrough: <"Trivial passthrough that echoes its input. Placeholder only; replace with real FIXML→CDM mappings when the FIXML workstream lands.">
    inputs:
        input string (1..1)
    output:
        result string (1..1)
    set result: input
